@startuml
title S4  Generate recipes and handle failures  US-07 / US-09
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontColor #172A3A
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam ArrowColor #345A72
skinparam Shadowing false
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam TitleFontColor #123A52
skinparam TitleFontSize 19
skinparam ClassBackgroundColor #EDF5FA
skinparam ClassBorderColor #456F89
skinparam ComponentBackgroundColor #EDF5FA
skinparam ComponentBorderColor #456F89
skinparam PackageBorderColor #456F89
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #E6F4F0
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #417364
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor #EDF5FA
skinparam SequenceGroupBorderColor #617C8D
hide footbox
autonumber
actor User
participant "Web UI" as UI
participant "Protected routes" as API
participant RecipeGenerationService as Gen
database "Input reader /\nrecipe repository" as Store
participant RecipeProvider as AI
participant CandidateValidator as Validate
User -> UI : request recipe suggestions
UI -> API : POST /recipes/generate
ref over API : S8: verified owner
API -> Gen : generate(owner)
Gen -> Store : snapshot(owner)
Store --> Gen : fridge names and original preference lists
alt empty fridge
  Gen --> API : empty fridge
  API --> UI : 400; prompt to add an ingredient
else names available
  Gen -> AI : generate(input, deadlineSignal)
  alt timeout or provider unavailable
    AI --> Gen : controlled provider failure
    Gen --> API : sanitized retryable failure
    API --> UI : 503 {error, retryable: true}
  else candidate batch returned
    AI --> Gen : candidate batch
    Gen -> Validate : validateBatch(candidates, exclusions)
    alt malformed or declared conflict
      Validate --> Gen : invalid shape or allergen conflict
      Gen --> API : sanitized validation failure
      API --> UI : 502 malformed or 422 declared conflict
    else entire batch accepted
      Validate --> Gen : validated batch
      Gen -> Store : insertBatch(owner, validated)
      Store --> Gen : committed recipes with internal IDs
      Gen --> API : complete Recipe[]
      API --> UI : 200 recipes
    end
  end
end
note over UI, Store
  Errors preserve prior state. Only accepted recipes are written.
  A user retry starts a fresh request with a new snapshot.
end note
@enduml
